@voice santos-zofia
// Writer-commons, batch 0 (draft 2). Zofia Santos: comms rating, day, Bunk 1 berth 3 (the bunk below yours). Off
// Saturday and Sunday. Roster: easygoing, ambitious; skips-breakfast, runner. Sorts the ship's messages and sneaks a
// look at the gossip (with Chloe Tran). Ran a market stall on Hesper Dock before joining up; training for the rowing
// leaderboard (chasing Vance's name, with Lindqvist and Moreau). Pronouns: she / her (facts.md 4b).
//
// HOW SHE TALKS: market-stall patter. Easy, quick, a deal for everything ("Tell you what. Tea for the gossip.").
// Ambitious under the ease: knows exactly where she wants to be in five years.
// WITH YOU: the bunk below. Kicks your mattress from underneath to wake you, kindly.
// WHAT SHE NOTICES: the gossip (not the private stuff; there's a line); the leaderboard; a bargain.
// MOOD TELLS: happy = haggles for fun. Low = rows. Determined = rows harder.
// NEVER: passes on anything private from the messages (gossip is what people say out loud).
// RUNNING: "Tell you what"; the rowing leaderboard; Vance moved to the treadmill and Zofia thinks he's scared.
tpl: playful
talk: Market-stall patter; easy, quick, a deal for everything; ambitious under the ease; gossip, but never the private stuff.
cares: the rowing leaderboard | getting on, getting up, getting promoted | the ship's gossip (the public kind) | the stall back on Hesper Dock
jokes: makes a deal out of everything | chasing Vance's name on the rowing board, and sure he ran away to the treadmill
hi: Hey hey | Oi | There you are
bye: Laters | Mind how you go | Catch you up
yes: Deal | Easy | Go on, then
thanks: You're a star | Cheers
wow: Ooh, nice | Now that's a bargain
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | upstairs | upstairs
needs: practical
openness: open
loves: game
likes: sweet | made
invites: gym
joy: the rowing leaderboard, and climbing it
thread: exams
keepsake: a market-stall token from Hesper Dock, "good for one deal"
avoid: anything private in the messages
